              _e_r_r_n_o is set to EEDDOOMM (but see BUGS).  An invalid  floating‐point
              exception (FFEE__IINNVVAALLIIDD) is raised.

       Domain error: _y is zero
              _e_r_r_n_o  is  set  to  EEDDOOMM.   An  invalid floating‐point exception
              (FFEE__IINNVVAALLIIDD) is raised.

